{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23583","headline":"夜闻贾常州崔湖州茶山境会想羡欢宴因寄此诗 · 白居易","name":"夜闻贾常州崔湖州茶山境会想羡欢宴因寄此诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"遥闻境会茶山夜，珠翠歌钟俱遶身。\n盘下中分两州界，灯前合作一家春。\n青娥遰舞应争妙，紫笋齐尝各鬬新。\n自叹花时北窗下，蒲黄酒对病眠人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23583.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23583","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}